---
// WhatsAppFloat: Floating direct action button
---

<aside aria-label="Contacto directo" class="fixed bottom-6 right-6 z-50 flex items-center gap-3">
  <!-- Interactive speech bubble (visible on desktop) -->
  <div class="hidden sm:flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-2 rounded-xl bg-surface-container-high border border-outline-variant/40 shadow-xl text-xs font-headline font-bold text-on-surface animate-bounce">
    <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-brand-mint"></span>
    ¿Dudas sobre tu supermercado? Hablá con nosotros
  </div>

  <a
    href="https://wa.me/595994516360?text=Hola%20InteliMarket,%20quisiera%20consultar%20sobre%20el%20sistema%20para%20mi%20comercio"
    target="_blank"
    rel="noopener noreferrer"
    aria-label="Contactar por WhatsApp"
    class="relative w-14 h-14 rounded-full bg-brand-mint text-brand-dark flex items-center justify-center shadow-[0_4px_20px_rgba(78,222,163,0.4)] hover:scale-110 active:scale-95 transition-all duration-300 group cursor-pointer"
  >
    <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[32px] group-hover:rotate-12 transition-transform">
      chat
    </span>
    <!-- Ping ring -->
    <span class="absolute -top-1 -right-1 w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-emerald-400 animate-ping"></span>
    <span class="absolute -top-1 -right-1 w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 border-2 border-surface"></span>
  </a>
</aside>
